WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.920 --> 00:00:05.640 line:87%
The better the teacher,
the better the world.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:10.200 line:87%
And the better the world,
the better our lives will be.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.080 line:94%
You need to be born a SEN teacher.

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:18.280 line:87%
I love my job.
I can't imagine doing anything else.

00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:23.840 line:87%
A SEN teacher gives
all their body, heart and mind.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:28.280 line:87%
But also all their energy,
which they use and which I use

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:34.080 line:87%
to guarantee the best
and most comprehensive development

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:39.320 line:87%
for my children,
because they are my children.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.200 line:94%
In 2012 I did a job shadowing

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.440 line:87%
at the Oathall Community College
in Haywards Heath, UK,

00:00:49.520 --> 00:00:54.440 line:87%
where I learnt new art techniques
such as papier-mâché,

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:58.360 line:87%
decoupage, ceramics
and jewellery-making.

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:02.960 line:87%
The teachers at my school were very
interested in the techniques I'd learnt

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.400 line:94%
in the United Kingdom.

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:08.200 line:87%
I did micro-teaching sessions,
workshops,

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:11.600 line:94%
newsletters on art techniques.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:16.400 line:87%
The job-shadowing programme
has encouraged other teachers

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.720 line:94%
to take part in similar initiatives.

00:01:21.440 --> 00:01:24.280 line:87%
Art plays a very important role
in educating disabled people.

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:29.560 line:87%
It is a key to a better understanding
of the world.

00:01:30.720 --> 00:01:34.960 line:87%
Through their artwork
children express their feelings,

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:40.240 line:87%
they show us their mind,
sometimes their thoughts.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:48.440 line:87%
Thanks to their work, we can find out
the best things about them.

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:52.080 line:94%
Even though they can't speak or hear.

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:54.040 line:87%
But they feel and express it
through their work.

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:00.280 line:87%
I have also worked together
with the parents,

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:04.360 line:87%
showing them the potential
and the skills their children have

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:09.680 line:87%
and how they can utilise them
in their future working life.

00:02:16.840 --> 00:02:19.840 line:87%
Erasmus+ has allowed me to open up
and accept new opportunities,

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:25.560 line:87%
has helped me express myself
and believe in myself,

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:30.320 line:87%
which allows me to apply everything
in my work at the school.

